.SH "نام (NAME)"
gnome-dictionary \- Look up words in online dictionaries
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBgnome\-dictionary\fR\ 'u
\fBgnome\-dictionary\fR [[\-\-look\-up\ \fIWORD\fR] | [\-\-match\ \fIWORD\fR]] [\-\-source\ \fINAME\fR] [\-\-database\ \fINAME\fR] [\-\-strategy\ \fINAME\fR] [\-\-help]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBgnome\-dictionary\fR
looks up words in online dictionaries using the DICT protocol\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\-\-look\-up \fIWORD\fR
.RS 4
Looks up the specified
\fIWORD\fR
using the default dictionary source, or the one specified with the
\fB\-\-source\fR
command line option\&.
.RE
.PP
\-\-match \fIWORD\fR
.RS 4
List all the entries in the dictionary source that match the specified
\fIWORD\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\-\-source=\fINAME\fR, \-s \fINAME\fR
.RS 4
Specifies the dictionary source to be used for looking up or matching words\&.
.RE
.PP
\-\-database=\fINAME\fR, \-D \fINAME\fR
.RS 4
Specifies the database in the dictionary source to be used for looking up or matching words\&.
.RE
.PP
\-\-strategy=\fINAME\fR, \-S \fINAME\fR
.RS 4
Specifies the matching strategy in the dictionary source to be used for looking up or matching words\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBEmmanuele Bassi\fR
.RS 4
Author
.RE
